## **八、需求七：日历签到图文广告指定人群配置**

### **8.1 页面路径**

营销管理 - 日历签到 - 图文广告（路由：`WeiXin/VipSignIn/Advert`）

### **8.2 需求描述**

在图文广告设计器中，支持对图文广告组件配置**指定人群门槛**，人群条件包括：

- 全部消费者（默认）
- 指定标签（满足指定会员标签）
- 分组（满足指定分组）
- 条件组合（关注+绑定手机+会员等级等）

### **8.3 前端改动**

| 文件 | 改动说明 |
|-|-|
| `src/view/signInAct/advert/index.jsx` | `buildActInvolveThreshold` 人群门槛构建 + `showParticipants: true` |

### **8.4 核心实现**

#### **保存参数构建**

```JavaScript
const involveThresholdList = [];
data.forEach(item => {
  if (item.type === 'image-ad' && item.participants === 1 && item.participationCondition) {
    involveThresholdList.push({
      IsInvolveThreshold: 1,
      Key: item['__ezrpc-design-uuid__'] || item.key || '',
      ActInvolveThreshold: this.buildActInvolveThreshold(item.participationCondition),
    });
  }
});

saveSigninAdvertData({
  ActAdvertHtml,
  Id,
  IsInvolveThreshold: involveThresholdList.length > 0 ? 1 : 0,
  ActInvolveThreshold: involveThresholdList.length > 0 ? involveThresholdList : null,
});
```

#### **buildActInvolveThreshold 门槛构建**

```JavaScript
buildActInvolveThreshold = (participationCondition) => {
  const { intendedFor, requirements, labelFor, groupFor } = participationCondition;
  const ActInvolveThreshold = { InvolveThreshold: {} };

  if (intendedFor === 'TJ') {
    // 全部消费者条件组合
    ActInvolveThreshold.AssignCroed = 1;
    requirements?.forEach(item => {
      if (item.type === 'GZ')   ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.IsNeedSubscribe = !!item.isSelected;
      if (item.type === 'JH')   ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.IsNeedBindPhone = !!item.isSelected;
      if (item.type === 'BKD')  { /* 绑定手机时间范围 */ }
      if (item.type === 'KKD')  { /* 开卡时间范围 */ }
      if (item.type === 'MV')   ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.IsBirthdayMonth = !!item.isSelected;
      if (item.type === 'VDJ')  { /* 会员等级 + 付费等级 */ }
    });
  } else if (intendedFor === 'BQ') {
    // 指定标签
    ActInvolveThreshold.AssignCroed = 2;
    ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.IsAllOrOneTag = labelFor?.satisfyType === 1;
    ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.TagIds = labelFor?.selectedSatisfies?.map(v => v.Id).join(',') || '';
  } else if (intendedFor === 'FZ') {
    // 分组
    ActInvolveThreshold.AssignCroed = 3;
    ActInvolveThreshold.InvolveThreshold.GroupIds = (groupFor || []).map(v => v.Id).join(',');
  }

  return ActInvolveThreshold;
}
```

